Jagex assets

Yama's geometry, colors, skeletons and animations, his dialogue head and its
emotes, and his throne - in export/, source/*.glb and bundle.dat, and in the
renders in notes/ and icon.png - are taken from the Old School RuneScape game
cache and are excluded from the license above.

